  45                       KCCIOT= KEYCODE+2       /CLEAR KEYBOARD FLAG, AC, SET READER RUN
  46                       KRBIOT= KEYCODE+6       /CLEAR KEYBOARD FLAG, LOAD CHARACTER INTO AC,
